
## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites
- MATLAB R2020b or later (with Simulink, Simscape Multibody)
- ADAMS 2019 or later (optional, for advanced dynamics)

### Quick Start
1. Clone this repository
2. Open `models/manipulator_7dof.slx` in Simulink
3. Run `src/dynamics_parameters.m` to load parameters
4. Simulate and visualize results

## 📊 Key Results

| Metric | Ground Simulation | On-Orbit Data | Error |
|--------|-------------------|---------------|-------|
| Capture time | 45.2 s | 46.1 s | 2.0% |
| Joint torque peak | 127 Nm | 131 Nm | 3.1% |
| End-effector position | [0.02, 0.01, 0.03] m | [0.03, 0.02, 0.02] m | <5% |

